RULES (libcqops CLAUDE.md, "Key Prohibitions")
----------------------------------------------
  * These files are VERBATIM MIRRORS of a FROZEN ABI. NEVER edit them here.
  * To pick up an ABI change, re-copy from CQ_lang at a NEW pinned revision
    and update this file. Do not hand-patch.
  * CQ_lang is a separate repository and is READ-ONLY from libcqops.
  * cmake/CqopsIntrinsicPin.cmake makes both sha256s a CONFIGURE-TIME hard
    error, on cmake/CqopsFreePairingPin.cmake's shape. It has TWO arms because
    that template FATALs on a COMMIT file carrying more than one hash line;
    the two labels above are deliberately distinct strings so each arm matches
    exactly one.

